{"about_the_game":"<strong>Miss Undefined</strong> has been whisked away by the dastardly <strong>Kill Screen</strong>. Go from Zero to Hero in this fast-paced platformer, chasing time, the high score, and eventually the <strong>Kill Screen</strong> itself.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581880/extras/fe2336ee0a2cd2a06c5f7c5c227a4872.poster.avif?t=1650498516\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581880/extras/fe2336ee0a2cd2a06c5f7c5c227a4872.webm?t=1650498516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581880/extras/fe2336ee0a2cd2a06c5f7c5c227a4872.mp4?t=1650498516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Super Mega Zero is a tight precision and puzzle platformer with shoot 'em up elements. Simply touch an upgrade and switch forms to go from classic, straight-forward platforming to the more puzzle-like action number system or Shoot' Em Up gameplay.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581880/extras/e80fd76003c9e856f69765cc1b438328.poster.avif?t=1650498516\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581880/extras/e80fd76003c9e856f69765cc1b438328.webm?t=1650498516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581880/extras/e80fd76003c9e856f69765cc1b438328.mp4?t=1650498516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Challenge over 200 handcrafted levels with a mix of platforming, puzzles, and shoot 'em up gameplay.<br></li><li>Arcade esthetics that brings you back to the 80s.<br></li><li>A banger chiptune soundtrack.<br></li><li>Collectable Pi:s (aka the tastiest number)</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"WORLD 0 CLEAR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1581880/ef5620b4fc6fe0a146375f76450fcaecffa970b3.jpg"},{"name":"WORLD 1 CLEAR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1581880/2a2da29fc983e950d18b3aad5b51e16dcc3b8a9d.jpg"},{"name":"WORLD 2 CLEAR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1581880/f10e69668734afd1015bfeda1a262ab91b594d03.jpg"},{"name":"WORLD 3 CLEAR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1581880/6e685344eabdc925fbb969f2cda6cdcffd9cd8e1.jpg"},{"name":"WORLD 4 CLEAR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1581880/45fc61e7cc48d36114814c5929d2140780dc3778.jpg"},{"name":"WORLD 5 CLEAR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1581880/bd5bbfe77692ede797500bb77271f9c32f3fdd0c.jpg"},{"name":"WORLD 6 CLEAR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1581880/1a12faf0b762d683a497aea260e818f6199add9d.jpg"},{"name":" WORLD 7 CLEAR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1581880/40e4073f3231fb3876a63ccef05243f42e8b5bf3.jpg"},{"name":"WORLD 8 CLEAR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1581880/f9e958bf7436a8329bab6f71298db610e8a1185e.jpg"},{"name":" WORLD 9 CLEAR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1581880/dff9c762fbca7c9b2bea712fbe5332317ce0456a.jpg"}],"total":13},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1581880?t=1650498516","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1581880/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1650498516","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c